(a beat)
But aren’t we talking about American citizens here?
People who haven’t yet been convicted of anything?

The room shifts. Someone finally said it.

Randall sets down his clicker. Takes a breath. When he speaks again, his tone has shifted from technical to something harder.

RANDALL
(beat)
How many arrests did the department make last year?

AGENT MORRISON
