He walks closer to his audience, leaving the safety of his podium.

RANDALL
Criminals are using every trick, every exploit, every advantage. 
(a beat)
It’s time to fight fire with fire.

The room remains silent. Uncomfortable but unable to argue with the math of dead agents.

RANDALL (CONT’D)
