Holy shit. It worked.

## Beat 18: Randall Detects the Breach
INT. FBI OFFICE - NIGHT - SIMULTANEOUS #29#

Randall alone at his desk. A LOUD ALERT sounds from his monitor.

He leans in. The screen shows: “ASSET 518 - DEVICE ACTIVATED - STORAGE FACILITY B, UNIT 447”

The color drains from his face.

RANDALL
(grabbing his phone)
Jensen, pick up. Pick up—

Voicemail. He’s already moving, grabbing his jacket, his weapon.

RANDALL (CONT’D)
(into phone)
Jensen — do not engage anyone at that location. Lock the unit and get out. I’m on my way.

He’s out the door.

## Beat 19: Jensen Catches the Criminals
INT. STORAGE FACILITY - UNIT 447 - NIGHT #30#

The unit door slides open. Franko and Judd step inside—

JENSEN (O.S.)
FREEZE! Federal agent!

Franko and Judd throw their hands up. AGENT JENSEN stands deeper inside the unit, service weapon drawn, badge visible. Behind him — the walls are covered in surveillance photos, red string, banker’s boxes. He was mid-catalog when the door opened.

JENSEN
Hands where I can see them! Move inside. Now.

Franko and Judd shuffle forward, hands raised. As they move deeper into the unit, we see what Jensen’s been working in — surveillance photos of Dominic at various locations, his diner booth, meeting associates. Red string connects points like a conspiracy theorist’s wet dream. Maps with distribution routes. Organizational charts.

FRANKO
(hands up, looking around)
Holy shit...

JUDD
(seeing the photos)
What the fucking fuck, man...

Jensen herds them to the back wall, positioning himself near the doorway. Textbook.

JENSEN
(into radio)
