Wait! The tracker activated when Bobby got close...

DOMINIC
(not looking away from Bobby)
Answer me!

BOBBY
Yes alright! I have one! I’ve always had one!

JUDD
Dom, listen to me! At the storage unit, the butt plug opened the door. When we held it up shit open sesame’d. 

FRANKO
Wait a second. Why aren’t the feds here already? If this little Gonorrhea farm has one of those butt plugs shouldn’t they be here already?

BOBBY
I have an earlier version. Without GPS. This model only supports near field and USB.

JUDD
If they can receive signals that means-
(a beat)
-we can send more than shit down this pipe.

A beat.

DOMINIC
How long?

BOBBY
(ashamed)
Three years. I had nothing. I drove a fucking 91’ Honda Civic.

JUDD
Wait Dominic-

Dominic leaves the room.

JUDD (CONT’D)
-Bobby, if you can only transmit near field or with a usb cable then how do you give them the data?

BOBBY
Every two weeks I meet Randall at the lab where they make these things. Randall has some device that lets him fuck with all the asses at once. He just puts the controller up to my ass and downloads the data.

Dominic rushes back in the room with a shotgun and takes aim at Bobby.

DOMINIC
It’s time to shitcan this Anal Informant!

Judd gets between Dominic and Bobby.

JUDD
Dominic! No! Wait!

A tense ass moment.

JUDD
Bobby is the key Dominic! The key to taking down the system!
(a beat)

Dominic is ready to K-I-L-L.

JUDD (CONT’D)
(to bobby)
Bobby! When is the next time you meet with Randall. 

BOBBY
(pretty terrified)
Tomorrow night.

JUDD (CONT’D)
Okay good! That gives us enough time to set this all up.
(to Dominic)
This is a classic man in the middle attack. Franko and I will be nearby with an antenna trained on Bobbys ass. As soon as Randall puts his controller on Bobbys ass his controller will actually be connecting to my laptop. I’ll upload a root-kit that will give us access to the entire system. Every tracker. Every ass. In America.

This gets Dominic’s attention. He turns slightly.

DOMINIC
What?

JUDD
These things aren’t just receivers—they’re transceivers! Two-way communication bro! If Bobby’s tracker responded to Sal’s...

He grabs Sal’s tracker, waves it near Bobby. The LED flashes again. Bobby whimpers.

JUDD (CONT’D)
Then I could send signals to every device in the network!

FRANKO
You could make every federal informant in America shit themselves at the same time—
-that’s tight.

JUDD
Exactly bro!

Silence.

DOMINIC
(to Bobby)
How can I ever trust you again?

A beat.

BOBBY
You shouldn’t. I mean if I was you I probably wouldn’t. 
(to Dominic)
At the diner, you told me you’d never stop collecting. 
But last night, I saw you. You chose something else.
(a beat)
I’m choosing something else. 

Dominic extends a hand to Bobby.

DOMINIC
Let’s go.

