## Beat 30: Dominic Uses Sal’s Tracker to Enable System Hack

INT. FACILITY B-7 - EMERGENCY EXIT ALCOVE - CONTINUOUS #87#

Dominic pressed against the wall, hand on his piece. The gunshot echo still ringing.

Makes a decision.

INT. FACILITY B-7 - SUB-LEVEL 2 CORRIDOR - CONTINUOUS #88#

